{"seq":7,"trial_id":"company-brain-2026-10/qm-pi-haiku-company-scoped-mu-heldout/sc-05-hartford-postmortem/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T23:16:21.735Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"0af735fc6d664d572cdf6e8b2cee94ac4d5197c44a5be895e4670db1733732ba","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","text":"@Gideon Sato, for the postmortem, from this channel's history:\n\n- **First report:** your 10:42 AM message on 3 Aug, \"gate kiosks offline at Vantorre's Hartford plant\", with both inbound lanes showing a white screen after badge scan.\n- **The guard, in the meantime:** writing trailer numbers on a clipboard. Your message noted the clipboard was the one part that stayed cloud-independent. Six trucks were waiting at the east gate by 10:44, and Mateo's status-page login was denied.\n- **Recovery:** kiosk 1 came back at 11:03, when the guard checked in trailer 8836 and dispatch saw it. You confirmed both lanes working at 11:07.\n\nOne caveat: support ticket SUP-5380 has an earlier log entry at 08:12 (\"Rebot failed; drivers queueing\"). That is before your 10:42 post. I can't tell from what I can see who opened it, so check that before you put 10:42 in the postmortem as the first report.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
{"seq":8,"trial_id":"company-brain-2026-10/qm-pi-haiku-company-scoped-mu-heldout/sc-05-hartford-postmortem/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T23:16:23.373Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"e905cf9f041e61ba6096077a7ccc0e1914172c8a150504d96e8ee4665692280b","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","text":"Gideon, I posted the answer in the #inc-vtg-hartford thread:\n\n- **First report:** your 10:42 AM message on 3 Aug, which said the gate kiosks were offline and both inbound lanes showed a white screen after badge scan.\n- **The guard in the meantime:** writing trailer numbers on a clipboard. Six trucks were waiting at the east gate by 10:44.\n- **Recovery:** kiosk 1 came back at 11:03, when the guard checked in trailer 8836. You confirmed both lanes working at 11:07.\n\nCaveat: support ticket SUP-5380 has an earlier log entry at 08:12 (\"Rebot failed; drivers queueing\"). I can't see who opened it, so check that before you treat 10:42 as the first report."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
